      "value": "I think if it's a toggleable option similar to \"Always Show Friends\", then this would be great as a feature.\n\nWe have the ability to restrict where stickers go. I think this would be a natural sibling to that type of feature.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
